12280857,2025-03-03,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Mobile or digital wallet,Unauthorized transactions or other transaction problem,,"Our family is the victim of a financial crime. The crime was enabled by the financial systems inability to police its online products. The facts of this care are egregious. 
