After tapping out the dormant business credit card, the thief moved to our personal accounts. The thief made another unauthorized {$3500.00} Cash Advance from our personal WF credit card to our WF Savings account. From there the thief XXXX  another XXXX unauthorized {$500.00} transactions to XXXX. 

