12612054,2025-03-22,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX I am submitting a formal dispute regarding late payment entries reported within the past two years on my credit file. These late payments resulted from unauthorized interference with my financial accounts due to a cybersecurity breach on my mobile device. As they are not a reflection of my financial behavior, I am requesting their immediate removal.

